{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cmeps_aoflux",
  "description": "CMEPS atmosphere-ocean bulk flux component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the pointwise laws of flux_atmOcn_large in cesm/flux_atmocn/flux_atmocn_Large.F90 (the Large & Pond / Large & Yeager scheme of the CESM mediator, cesm3.0-alphabranch checkout) transcribed exactly, with the expression templates of ./cmeps_templates.esm imported by reference. The traced configuration (the C_JRA_t62 DATM+MOM6 case, nuopc.runconfig of the instrumented run): add_gusts = .false., coldair_outbreak_mod = .false., aofluxes_use_shr_wv_sat = .true. (the shr_wv_sat Goff & Gratch / qsat path), minwind = 0.5 m/s (seq_flux_atmocn_minwind), flux_convergence = 0.01 and flux_max_iteration = 5 (the do-while of F90:242-290). Structure, in the order of the Fortran: (a) the 12 raw inputs zbot/ubot/vbot/thbot/qbot/rainc/rbot/tbot/pslv/us/vs/ts (the flux_atmOcn_large argument list, F90:50-67); (b) the derived inputs of F90:193-229: vmag and wind0 (the minwind-clamped relative wind, gustiness absent here so vmag = wind0), esat_raw (Goff & Gratch at ts), esat = min(esat_raw, pslv), qsat from the RAW es (shr_wv_sat_qsat_liquid calls svp_to_qsat with the unminned es, shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:439-441), ssq = 0.98*qsat, delt, delq, alz = ln(zbot/10), cp = cpdair*(1 + cpvir*ssq); (c) the neutral coefficients of F90:236-240 (stable0 = 0.5 + sign(0.5, delt) as a 0/1 selection, rdn0 = sqrt(cdn(vmag)), rhn0 = (1-stable0)*0.0327 + stable0*0.018, ren0 = 0.0346, ustar0/tstar0/qstar0); (d) the stability iteration of F90:242-290 unrolled to the fixed flux_max_iteration = 5 updates (the esm has no loop construct; each update computes hol (the Monin-Obukhov stability parameter, |hol| <= 10 sign-preserving clamp of F90:254), the stability selection, xsq/xqq, the psi functions, the clamped wind-shift rdw of F90:272, u10n = vmag*rdw/rdn, the updated neutral coefficients rdn = sqrt(cdn(u10n)) and rhn, the height-shifted rd/rh/re of F90:282-284, and ustar/tstar/qstar), with the per-update convergence flags conv_k = |(ustar_k - ustar_{k-1})/ustar_k| <= 0.01 for k = 1..4 (the Fortran exit test of F90:286-287) and the iteration count iter = the first converged k, else 5; the 16 exit-state fields (hol/stable/xsq/xqq/psimh/psixh/rd/u10n/rdn/rhn/ren/rh/re/ustar/tstar/qstar) are selected from the unrolled updates by nested ifelse on iter (the Fortran leaves the last-update values in the variables at exit); (e) the fluxes of F90:299-311 (tau = rbot*ustar^2, taux/tauy = tau*(ubot-us)/vmag etc., sen, lat = latvap*tau*qstar/ustar, lwup = -stebol*ts^4, evap = lat/latvap); (f) the diagnostics of F90:316-333 (hol2 = hol*ztref/zbot and the 2-m psi, the fac_t/fac_q interpolation factors, tref = thbot - delt*fac_t - 0.01*ztref, qref, duu10n = u10n^2, u10res = u10n*wind0/vmag). Constants are the CESM shr_const values the nuopc cap uses (cpdair = 1004.64, cpvir = 1810/1004.64 - 1, latvap = 2.501e6, stebol = 5.67e-8, karman = 0.4, grav = 9.80616, zvir = 28.966/18.016 - 1, epsilo = 18.016/28.966, omeps = 1 - epsilo). The ren = 0.0346 water coefficient is constant across the iteration and is carried once (ren0, ren and the re_k shifts all bind it). Documented divergences: (1) the iteration is unrolled and exit-selected instead of looped (algebraically identical; conv_k and iter are explicit); (2) the rainc input is unused in this configuration (add_gusts = .false.); the stage-1 dump sanitizes it to 0 after the mediator's 1-element dummy allocation was exposed as an out-of-bounds read (bugs.md #28); (3) the traced window (12 PET-0 ocean cells of the 24 coupling steps, all ~69 S Antarctic coast, 288 rows) is entirely unstable with low-to-moderate wind: the stable branch (stable0 = 1, the rhn = 0.018 ratio, the -5*hol stable psi), the cdn 33 m/s wind cap, the gustiness path and the cold-air-outbreak path are NOT exercised by the dump and carry no dump pins; the minwind = 0.5 m/s floor and the |hol| <= 10 clamp ARE exercised (rows with vmag = 0.5 and hol = -10.0 pinned). The tests block pins 6 dump rows (convergence at iterations 2/3/4/5/5/2, including the two clamp rows) at time_span {0,0} with all 47 dumped columns at full dump precision (rel 1e-12) plus the conv_k/iter representation. Reference: stage1/cesm/components/cmeps/cesm/flux_atmocn/flux_atmocn_Large.F90; the replay that reproduces all 288 dump rows to <= 4.4e-15 relative is stage1/analysis/validate_cmeps_dump.py."
 },
 "models": {
  "AoFlux": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "./cmeps_templates.esm" }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "zbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 10.0,
     "description": "height of the lowest atmosphere model level (F90:56), [m]"
    },
    "ubot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": -2.5053703459796655,
     "description": "zonal wind at zbot (F90:57), [m/s]"
    },
    "vbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 1.0523198010187174,
     "description": "meridional wind at zbot (F90:58), [m/s]"
    },
    "thbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "default": 271.666139623882,
     "description": "potential temperature at zbot (F90:59), [K]"
    },
    "qbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "default": 0.0020241880033025007,
     "description": "specific humidity at zbot (F90:60), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "rainc": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "convective rain for the gustiness term (F90:61); unused in the traced configuration (add_gusts = .false.) and dumped as 0 after the mediator's 1-element dummy allocation was exposed as an out-of-bounds read (bugs.md #28), [kg/m2/s]"
    },
    "rbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "default": 1.2777012762287812,
     "description": "density of air at zbot (F90:62), [kg/m3]"
    },
    "tbot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "default": 271.666139623882,
     "description": "temperature at zbot (F90:63); part of the flux_atmOcn_large interface but not consumed by the physics in this configuration, [K]"
    },
    "pslv": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa",
     "default": 99756.84487865833,
     "description": "sea level pressure (F90:64), [Pa]"
    },
    "us": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "zonal ocean surface current (F90:65), [m/s]"
    },
    "vs": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "meridional ocean surface current (F90:66), [m/s]"
    },
    "ts": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "default": 275.0527096440321,
     "description": "ocean surface temperature (F90:67), [K]"
    },
    "vmag": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "wind magnitude used in the iteration (F90:193-196): the relative wind sqrt((ubot-us)^2 + (vbot-vs)^2) floored at minwind = 0.5 m/s; with add_gusts = .false. no gustiness is added, [m/s]"
    },
    "wind0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "resolved wind without the gustiness addition (F90:204), minwind-clamped like vmag; equals vmag in the traced configuration, [m/s]"
    },
    "ugust": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "convective gustiness term ugust(min(rainc, 6.94444e-4)) (F90:197-202); identically 0 in the traced configuration (add_gusts = .false.), [m/s]"
    },
    "esat_raw": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "saturation vapor pressure at ts from the Goff & Gratch (1946) liquid-water formula (shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:942-956, the aofluxes_use_shr_wv_sat = .true. branch of F90:217-225), BEFORE the min(es, pslv) cap of shr_wv_sat_qsat_liquid, [Pa]"
    },
    "esat": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "esat = min(esat_raw, pslv) (shr_wv_sat_qsat_liquid, shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:439-441), [Pa]"
    },
    "qsat": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "saturation specific humidity qs = epsilo*es/(p - omeps*es) with the p <= es guard from the RAW es (shr_wv_sat_svp_to_qsat is called with the unminned es, shr_wv_sat_mod.F90:351-363, 439-441), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "ssq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "sea surface humidity = 0.98*qsat (F90:221), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "delt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "potential temperature difference thbot - ts (F90:223), [K]"
    },
    "delq": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "specific humidity difference qbot - ssq (F90:224), [kg/kg]"
    },
    "alz": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "ln(zbot/zref) with zref = 10 m (F90:225), [-]"
    },
    "cp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/kg/K",
     "description": "specific heat of moist air cp = cpdair*(1 + cpvir*ssq) (F90:226, shr_const cpvir = 1810/1004.64 - 1), [J/kg/K]"
    },
    "stable0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "first-estimate stability factor stable = 0.5 + sign(0.5, delt) (F90:237): 1 stable (delt >= 0), 0 unstable, [-]"
    },
    "rdn0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "neutral 10-m sqrt drag coefficient sqrt(cdn(vmag)) (F90:238), [-]"
    },
    "rhn0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "neutral 10-m sqrt heat coefficient (1 - stable0)*0.0327 + stable0*0.018 (F90:239), [-]"
    },
    "ren0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "neutral 10-m sqrt water coefficient = 0.0346 (F90:240), [-]"
    },
    "ustar0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "first-estimate friction velocity rdn0*vmag (F90:242), [m/s]"
    },
    "tstar0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "first-estimate friction temperature rhn0*delt (F90:243), [K]"
    },
    "qstar0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "first-estimate friction humidity ren0*delq (F90:244), [kg/kg]"
    },
